<div id="abaGiroSemanal" class="aba-conteudo hidden h-full flex flex-col">
    <div class="bg-white p-4 shadow-sm border-b border-slate-200 flex-shrink-0 z-20 relative">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-800 tracking-tight">🌪️ Giro Diário (Backlogs)</h2>
        <p class="text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-widest mt-1">Coleta esperada e realizada · Backlogs e próximos prazos</p>
    </div>

    <div class="flex-1 overflow-y-auto p-2 scroller bg-neutral-100">
    <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 mb-8">
        <h3 class="text-xs font-black text-slate-700 uppercase mb-2">Curva de Coleta Prevista — Esperado x Realizado</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mb-4">Base, planejamento e volume coletado seguem exatamente os filtros Origem e Destino aplicados no portal.</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-5 text-xs text-slate-600">
            <label class="border border-slate-200 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 cursor-pointer"><input type="radio" name="visaoColetaFunilGiro" value="mensal" checked onchange="renderColetaFinalFunil('Giro')"> Mensal (fechado por mês)</label>
            <label class="border border-slate-200 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 cursor-pointer"><input type="radio" name="visaoColetaFunilGiro" value="atual" onchange="renderColetaFinalFunil('Giro')"> Mês Atual</label>
            <label class="border border-slate-200 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 cursor-pointer"><input type="radio" name="visaoColetaFunilGiro" value="personalizado" onchange="renderColetaFinalFunil('Giro')"> Data personalizada</label>
            <div id="periodoColetaFunilGiro" class="hidden flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
                <label>De <input id="inicioColetaFunilGiro" type="date" class="border rounded px-2 py-1" onchange="renderColetaFinalFunil('Giro')"></label>
                <label>Até <input id="fimColetaFunilGiro" type="date" class="border rounded px-2 py-1" onchange="renderColetaFinalFunil('Giro')"></label>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 mb-3">
            <button type="button" onclick="exportarAuditoriaMetaColeta()" class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-600 border border-slate-200 rounded px-3 py-1.5 hover:bg-slate-50">Baixar auditoria do forecast</button>
            <button id="btnForecastColetaFunilGiro" type="button" onclick="window.pgAbrirEditorForecastColeta('Giro')" class="hidden text-xs font-bold text-violet-700 border border-violet-200 bg-violet-50 rounded px-3 py-1.5 hover:bg-violet-100">Registrar Meta</button>
        </div>
        <div id="editorForecastColetaFunilGiro" class="hidden mb-4"></div>
        <div id="resumoColetaFinalFunilGiro" class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 text-xs text-slate-700 mb-4"></div>
        <div class="overflow-x-auto scroller">
            <div id="larguraColetaFunilGiro">
                <div class="relative h-80"><canvas id="grafColetaFinalFunilGiro"></canvas></div>
                <div id="diasColetaFunilGiro" style="display:grid;padding:0 24px"></div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <a id="linkExtracaoColetaFunilGiro" hidden target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-xs font-bold text-blue-700 underline">Abrir planilha extraída</a>
        <p id="notaColetaFinalFunilGiro" class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-3"></p>
    </div>
        <div>
<div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow border border-slate-200 mt-6 p-5 w-full">
    
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 mb-6 pb-6 border-b border-slate-200 w-full">
        <div class="w-full">
            <label class="text-[10px] font-extrabold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wider block mb-2">Filtrar por Etapa Pendente:</label>
            <div id="filtroEtapasGiro" class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 w-full"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="w-full flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 items-end bg-slate-50 p-3 rounded-lg border border-slate-200">
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5">
                <span class="text-[10px] font-extrabold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Status Geral:</span>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700">
            <label class="flex items-center gap-1.5 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" id="chkGiroAberto" checked onchange="window.reFiltrarTabelaGiro()" class="rounded border-slate-300 text-indigo-600"> Em Aberto</label>
            <label class="flex items-center gap-1.5 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" id="chkGiroPos" checked onchange="window.reFiltrarTabelaGiro()" class="rounded border-slate-300 text-rose-600"> Coletado a menos</label>
            <label class="flex items-center gap-1.5 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" id="chkGiroConcluido" onchange="window.reFiltrarTabelaGiro()" class="rounded border-slate-300 text-indigo-600"> Concluído</label>
            <label class="flex items-center gap-1.5 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" id="chkGiroCancelado" onchange="window.reFiltrarTabelaGiro()" class="rounded border-slate-300 text-indigo-600"> Cancelado</label>
            </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="flex-1 w-full flex flex-col gap-1">
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center text-[10px] font-extrabold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wider">
                    <span>Dias para Vencimento (Atraso = Negativo):</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3 w-full mt-1">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-white px-2 py-1 rounded border border-slate-300 w-1/2">
                        <span class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-bold">Mín:</span>
                        <input type="number" id="sldGiroDiasMin" value="-90" onchange="window.atualizarSliderGiro()" class="w-full text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 outline-none text-center">
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-white px-2 py-1 rounded border border-slate-300 w-1/2">
                        <span class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-bold">Máx:</span>
                        <input type="number" id="sldGiroDiasMax" value="15" onchange="window.atualizarSliderGiro()" class="w-full text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 outline-none text-center">
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex-1 w-full flex flex-col gap-1 border-l border-slate-200 pl-4">
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center text-[10px] font-extrabold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wider">
                    <span>Filtro de Observações:</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2 w-full mt-1">
                    <select id="filtroObsStatus" onchange="window.reFiltrarTabelaGiro()" class="bg-white border border-slate-300 text-slate-700 rounded p-1 text-[10px] font-bold outline-none cursor-pointer w-1/3">
                        <option value="TODOS">Todas</option>
                        <option value="ATUALIZADO">Com Obs.</option>
                        <option value="NAO_ATUALIZADO">Sem Obs.</option>
                    </select>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-1 bg-white px-2 py-1 rounded border border-slate-300 w-1/3">
                        <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 font-bold" title="Dias sem atualizar (Mínimo)">Mín:</span>
                        <input type="number" id="filtroObsDiasMin" placeholder="0" onchange="window.reFiltrarTabelaGiro()" class="w-full text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 outline-none text-center">
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-1 bg-white px-2 py-1 rounded border border-slate-300 w-1/3">
                        <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 font-bold" title="Dias sem atualizar (Máximo)">Máx:</span>
                        <input type="number" id="filtroObsDiasMax" placeholder="Ex: 5" onchange="window.reFiltrarTabelaGiro()" class="w-full text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 outline-none text-center">
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
            <h3 class="text-xs font-black text-slate-700 uppercase tracking-widest flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-slate-500 text-lg">📋</span> Visão de Prazos e Entregas (Giro Semanal)
            </h3>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <button id="btnExportarFiltrados" onclick="window.exportarPendenciasGiroVisiveis()" class="text-[10px] font-bold text-white bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 px-3 py-1.5 rounded transition-colors shadow-sm flex items-center gap-1">📊 Exportar Filtrados (Sheets)</button>
            <button id="btnEnviarPendencias" onclick="window.enviarEmailPendencias()" class="text-[10px] font-bold text-white bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700 px-3 py-1.5 rounded transition-colors shadow-sm flex items-center gap-1">✉️ Enviar Painel (E-mail)</button>
            <button onclick="window.limparOrdenacaoGiro()" class="text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-600 bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 px-3 py-1.5 rounded transition-colors shadow-sm">
            Limpar Ordenação
            </button>
            <button onclick="document.querySelectorAll('.subtabela-detalhes').forEach(el => el.classList.toggle('hidden'))" class="text-[10px] font-bold text-indigo-600 bg-indigo-50 hover:bg-indigo-100 px-3 py-1.5 rounded transition-colors shadow-sm">
            Expandir / Recolher Todos
            </button>
            </div>
            </div>
    <div class="overflow-x-auto scroller">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse text-xs whitespace-nowrap">
<thead class="bg-slate-100 text-slate-500 uppercase text-[9px] border-b-2 border-slate-300 select-none">
                <tr>
                    <th class="p-2 font-bold w-8 text-center">Det.</th>
                    <th class="p-2 font-bold border-r border-slate-200 cursor-pointer hover:bg-slate-200" onclick="window.ordenarTabelaGiro('grafica')">Gráfica <span id="sort_grafica"></span></th>
                    <th class="p-2 font-bold border-r border-slate-200 cursor-pointer hover:bg-slate-200" onclick="window.ordenarTabelaGiro('marca')">Marca <span id="sort_marca"></span></th>
                    <th class="p-2 font-bold border-r border-slate-200 cursor-pointer hover:bg-slate-200" onclick="window.ordenarTabelaGiro('serie')">Série <span id="sort_serie"></span></th>
                    <th class="p-2 font-bold border-r border-slate-200 cursor-pointer hover:bg-slate-200 text-center" onclick="window.ordenarTabelaGiro('status')">Status Geral <span id="sort_status"></span></th>
                    <th class="p-2 font-bold border-r border-slate-200 cursor-pointer hover:bg-slate-200" onclick="window.ordenarTabelaGiro('pendencia')">Etapa Pendente <span id="sort_pendencia"></span></th>
                    <th class="p-2 font-bold border-r border-slate-200 text-center cursor-pointer hover:bg-slate-200" onclick="window.ordenarTabelaGiro('qtd')">Qtd. SKU's <span id="sort_qtd"></span></th>
                    <th class="p-2 font-bold border-r border-slate-200 text-right cursor-pointer hover:bg-slate-200" onclick="window.ordenarTabelaGiro('tiragemTotal')">Tiragem Total <span id="sort_tiragemTotal"></span></th>
                    <th class="p-2 font-bold w-1/4">Observações (Ação / Motivo)</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody id="tbodyPontosAtencaoGiro" class="divide-y divide-slate-100 text-slate-700"></tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
</div>
    
    

        </div>
    </div>
</div>